ttps://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Silene_nocturna"},"ciclo":{"valor":"Anual","fuente":"Wikipedia (es)"},"forma":{"valor":"hierba","fuente":"Wikipedia (es)"},"fotosLibres":[{"fuente":"Wikimedia Commons","archivo":"Silene apetala kz01.jpg","autor":"Krzysztof Ziarnek, Kenraiz","lic":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","pagina":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Silene_apetala_kz01.jpg","nivel":"taxon"},{"fuente":"iNaturalist","url":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/31624818/medium.jpeg","autor":"Ron Frumkin","lic":"CC BY-NC","licUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/deed.es","pagina":"https://www.inaturalist.org/photos/31624818","nivel":"taxon"},{"fuente":"iNaturalist","url":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/220291286/medium.jpg","autor":"jjudy","lic":"CC BY-NC","licUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/deed.es","pagina":"https://www.inaturalist.org/photos/220291286","nivel":"taxon"},{"fuente":"iNaturalist","url":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/109868297/medium.jpeg","autor":"faluke","lic":"CC BY-NC","licUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/deed.es","pagina":"https://www.inaturalist.org/photos/109868297","nivel":"taxon"},{"fuente":"iNaturalist","url":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/231434687/medium.jpeg","autor":"Γιώργος Παντάκης","lic":"CC BY-NC","licUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/deed.es","pagina":"https://www.inaturalist.org/photos/231434687","nivel":"taxon"}],"evc":{"url":"https://endemicascanarias.com/es/allcategories-es-es/nativas/silene-apetala","titulo":"Especies Vegetales en Canarias","autoria":"Gerardo G. Casanova y colaboradores"},"mundo":{"nativa":["suroeste de Europa","sureste de Europa","norte de África","Macaronesia","África tropical nororiental","oeste de Asia","península arábiga","subcontinente indio"],"introducida":[],"nAreasNativa":29,"nAreasIntroducida":0,"fuente":"WCVP (Kew)","url":"https://powo.science.kew.org/taxon/urn:lsid:ipni.org:names:303044-2","nivel":"taxon","nombre":null},"etimologia":{"texto":"El nombre del género está ciertamente vinculado al personaje de Sileno (en griego Σειληνός; en latín Sīlēnus), padre adoptivo y preceptor de Dionisos, siempre representado con vientre hinchado similar a los cálices de numerosas especies, por ejemplo Silene vulgaris o Silene conica. Aunque también se ha evocado (Teofrasto via Lobelius y luego  Linneo)  un posible origen a partir del Griego σίαλoν, ου, \"saliva, moco, baba\", aludiendo a la viscosidad de ciertas especies, o bien σίαλος, oν, \"gordo\", que sería lo mismo que la primera interpretación, o sea, inflado/hinchado.\nnocturna; epíteto latino que significa \"de la noche\".","fuente":"Wikipedia en español","url":"https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Silene_nocturna"},"rasgos":[{"grupo":"Forma de vida","k":"Forma vital","v":"anual","fuente":"WCVP (Kew)","url":"https://powo.science.kew.org/taxon/urn:lsid:ipni.org:names:303044-2"},{"grupo":"Forma de vida","k":"Clima","v":"subtropical","fuente":"WCVP (Kew)","url":"https://powo.science.kew.org/taxon/urn:lsid:ipni.org:names:303044-2"},{"grupo":"Genética","k":"Número cromosomático","v":"2n = 24; n = 12","fuente":"CCDB","url":"https://ccdb.tau.ac.il/search/?genus=Silene"}],"altitud":{"p5":40,"p95":830,"min":20,"max":2210,"n":119,"fuente":"Registros de GBIF en Canarias y modelo del terreno Copernicus GLO-90","url":"https://www.gbif.org/occurrence/search?taxon_key=6363958&geometry=POLYGON((-18.5 27.4,-13.2 27.4,-13.2 29.5,-18.5 29.5,-18.5 27.4))"}}